# 换行符统一：一律以 LF 存入仓库，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间
# 产生「整个文件都改了」的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件显式声明，防止被换行符规范化破坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# 冒烟测试生成的媒体夹具
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.ts binary
